{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本細則依共同管道法（以下簡稱本法）第三十三條規定訂定之。","id":"D0070048/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"0e3ddecd5020c6998b6061ecd2d7e9a7a58d8f806b7194675585417484c54a63","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依本法第八條第一項規定辦理共同管道系統公告時，其公告期間為三十日，並通知當地相關公共工程主管機關及管線事業機關（構）。變更或廢止時，亦同。\n前項共同管道系統，得依實際情況分段公告之，並應以文字或圖表表明下列事項：\n一、行政區域及規劃地區範圍。\n二、共同管道位置、名稱及種類。\n三、規劃目標年期。\n四、共同管道系統規劃圖。\n五、相關都市計畫及區域計畫。\n前項第三款規劃目標年期，不得少於二十五年；第四款共同管道系統規劃圖，其比例不得小於一萬分之一。","id":"D0070048/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"ee10bc1f40f939ee3c04cd091da5e56a77bf5f83bc188f9e358a44bc1d552d26","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":82,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":82,"end":188,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:2/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":119,"end":134,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:2/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":134,"end":150,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:2/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":150,"end":160,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:2/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":160,"end":173,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:2/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":173,"end":188,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070048/a:2/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":188,"end":235,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"共同管道系統公告後，申請計畫性挖掘該系統內之道路者，應依下列規定，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關提出檢討計畫：\n一、未規劃納入共同管道系統之管線事業機關（構）申請挖掘時，應提出配合共同管道系統之管線網路檢討。\n二、已規劃納入共同管道系統之管線事業機關（構）申請挖掘時，應提出配合共同管道系統之建設時程檢討。\n三、公共工程主辦機關申請挖掘時，應提出配合共同管道系統之建設時程檢討。","id":"D0070048/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"e50190d2c06048130d33b427152db2821c041a74185fe8289825d99fa0fe874d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":187,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":54,"end":103,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":103,"end":152,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:3/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":152,"end":187,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依本法第八條第三項規定辦理共同管道系統通盤檢討時應考量下列因素：\n一、配合都市發展或都市計畫之變更。\n二、配合交通設施之新建或道路系統之更新。\n三、配合共同管道系統網路之建立。\n四、管線事業機關（構）之建議。\n五、其他與共同管道系統有關之公共建設。","id":"D0070048/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"4294a19fcd5d6e465bbbd1436235309f9c84c647053ef639de8ecc421119386e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":136,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":45,"end":63,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":63,"end":84,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":84,"end":101,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:4/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":101,"end":117,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:4/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":117,"end":136,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依本法第九條第一項規定訂定實施計畫時，應視其實際情況，以文字或圖表表明下列事項：\n一、計畫名稱。\n二、行政區域及計畫地區範圍。\n三、計畫年期。\n四、計畫年期內人口及經濟發展之推計。\n五、住宅、商業、工業與其他土地使用之配置及管制。\n六、道路系統及相關建設計畫。\n七、現有管線系統。\n八、各類管線系統在計畫年期內之需求規模推計。\n九、實施建設進度、經費及財務計畫。\n十、共同管道種類及平面配置；其配置圖之比例，不得小於一千分之一。\n十一、共同管道斷面配置。\n十二、共同管道之預定使用管線事業機關（構）及使用部分。\n十三、禁止挖掘道路之範圍及期間。","id":"D0070048/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"a8ef7a16fb942939c23e840cf06c165491803a40704a894a6acb28d2323d91af","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":284,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":53,"end":61,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":61,"end":76,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":76,"end":84,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":84,"end":103,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":103,"end":128,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":128,"end":143,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":143,"end":153,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:8","kind":"item","number":8,"start":153,"end":176,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:9","kind":"item","number":9,"start":176,"end":194,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:10","kind":"item","number":10,"start":194,"end":227,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:11","kind":"item","number":11,"start":227,"end":240,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:12","kind":"item","number":12,"start":240,"end":268,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:5/p:1/i:13","kind":"item","number":13,"start":268,"end":284,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"前條第三款計畫年期之訂定，應考量下列因素：\n一、配合區域計畫或都市計畫之計畫年期。\n二、管線之需求年期。\n三、共同管道構造物之耐久年期。\n四、道路建設計畫年限。\n五、共同管道種類。","id":"D0070048/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"e163fdae1bc5eb5da941dc511e62ea3bcb77ba7e08c0eb12a2e0ca012ed2ef9b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":90,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:6/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":22,"end":42,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:6/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":42,"end":53,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:6/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":53,"end":69,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:6/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":69,"end":81,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:6/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":81,"end":90,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依本法第九條第一項規定訂定實施計畫時，各該管線事業機關（構）應配合辦理。","id":"D0070048/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"b8456f824d6a8cc63dd2dfde0e436ad3f6f5a914fc1973a133aec48a9b4fe4e7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":48,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"本法第十條第一項所稱實際需要，係指配合都市發展、交通建設、管線建設、天然災害、事變或其他公共建設等需要。","id":"D0070048/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"bad021b757c14d6f225f5acef89232b7226e83426d69c46623ea13236dfd0a98","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":52,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"有關機關（構）依本法第十條第一項規定向主管機關提出申請時，應檢附共同管道系統規劃書、圖及共同管道實施計畫書、圖。\n前項共同管道系統規劃書、圖，應載明第二條第二項之公告事項；共同管道實施計畫書、圖，應載明第五條之事項。","id":"D0070048/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"5305e3b935c4269abd85753f8f64233e1df7a636b916fb6c9d83ffeed2eabed1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":57,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:9/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":57,"end":108,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"主管機關依本法第十三條規定辦理禁止挖掘道路範圍之公告，應載明下列事項：\n一、共同管道種類。\n二、共同管道實施建設進度。\n三、禁止挖掘道路範圍及期間。","id":"D0070048/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"2abb523d0f681f64af02f376b2b5699f837d090cf9c5c73e85ed12e39de16970","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":74,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:10/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":36,"end":46,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:10/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":46,"end":60,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:10/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":60,"end":74,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"管線事業機關（構）依本法第二十三條第一項規定提出貸款申請時，應檢附下列文件：\n一、工程或投資計畫及經費概算。\n二、申請貸款金額及償還計畫。\n三、其他經中央主管機關認為有必要提出之文件。","id":"D0070048/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"b7d17f7aa013e8de6775b4bfbc1aa31507a89f7551bde061232463de7ba3d2a1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":92,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:11/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":39,"end":55,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:11/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":55,"end":70,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:11/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":70,"end":92,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"主管機關應將已完成之共同管道工程之下列資料，建檔保管：\n一、共同管道工程平面圖。\n二、開工、竣工日期及竣工圖。\n三、共同管道工程記事表。\n四、共同管道收容管線數量表。\n五、共同管道管線使用配置斷面圖及數量表。\n六、其他有關共同管道操作、維護、管理應行記載事項。","id":"D0070048/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"ec1dd0ab38329a47781bbcb78d01a1dc942bf50e0a25da2698cc78d04050763b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":130,"children":[{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":28,"end":41,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":41,"end":56,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":56,"end":69,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":69,"end":84,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":84,"end":105,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070048/a:12/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":105,"end":130,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"本細則所定書、表格式，由中央主管機關定之。","id":"D0070048/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"e4ae053ab61a12b54abd365dde6ad185c873eef98ecec6a8d6e41e38d46528db","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":21,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":[],"text":"本細則自發布日施行。","id":"D0070048/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"11f89414ed2c20ffe85ac9fa8eac63b69db677b93dc36b5013a401e4441cf217","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070048/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"環境與其他規範","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國九十年十二月二十八日內政部（90）台內營字第 9067834  號\n  令訂定發布全文 14 條","id":"D0070048","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2001-12-28","name":"共同管道法施行細則","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070048","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"5ff19595985d565dc970c223f927552c23c504ade08561fdc28d97f1e37ecb91","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2001-12-28","effectiveDate":""}}